Z||000000||Formula||02-09-2001||11:07 AM||||I put new halogen bulbs in my fog lights and regrounded them with a better ground.  they loks really bright now, before they were staring to dim but Im happy with them now!!<P>I also wired my headlight motors up to a switch (old idea).  the only reason I did this was so I would only have to crank them up once a night, but now when I turn them on they work fine.  I rebuilt the bad motor several months ago and it makes a horrible shreiking noise coming back down.  it still makes the noise but it akes it all the way up now!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellowtored3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
